WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:38.030 --> 01:41.080
They got into a traffic accident, the both of them.

01:41.080 --> 01:43.210
You have to feel for him.

01:45.770 --> 01:50.550
At any rate, although he lost his
parents, he hasn't shed a single tear.

01:50.550 --> 01:53.590
Oh my. And they say he hasn't
been going to school either.

01:57.710 --> 01:59.730
<i>There once was a foolish child,</i>

02:00.330 --> 02:04.600
<i>ever so powerless, ever so ignorant.</i>

02:08.190 --> 02:13.020
<i>He had a terrible father who always went into drunken rages and slept with other women.</i>

02:13.020 --> 02:17.610
<i>And a mother who would put up with it all, unwilling to confront him.</i>

02:22.870 --> 02:24.870
Why don't you divorce him already?

02:25.410 --> 02:28.040
I'll pick up a part-time job after school.

02:28.040 --> 02:29.890
Let's leave this house.

02:30.350 --> 02:34.470
Don't worry. I am perfectly fine.

02:35.290 --> 02:41.140
<i>The child thought that his mother endured the abuse for his sake.</i>

02:43.270 --> 02:44.640
What the hell are you starin' at?

02:45.050 --> 02:48.030
How d'ya think yer able to eat around here?!

02:55.130 --> 02:59.170
<i>The mother was not enduring it for the child's sake. </i>

03:00.470 --> 03:05.150
<i>She was willing to sacrifice the
child just to cling onto the house.</i>

03:07.450 --> 03:08.870
They can just die.

03:11.750 --> 03:15.320
Reiji, what's wrong with you?
You were such a good boy!

03:15.320 --> 03:18.520
I don't give a damn! You loused
up raising him anyway!

03:18.520 --> 03:20.350
Reiji!

03:28.560 --> 03:30.790
The both of you can just die!

03:43.370 --> 03:44.650
Reiji.

03:47.550 --> 03:49.910
Being here must be hard for you.

03:50.660 --> 03:55.420
You have your cousin, Aki-neechan.
It might be best if you went to Tokyo.

03:57.570 --> 03:59.170
<i>Getting rid of a problem, huh?</i>

04:00.590 --> 04:02.110
<i>Everyone of you can just die.</i>

04:08.230 --> 04:09.940
Hey! Rin, wait!

04:14.790 --> 04:16.170
Reiji?

04:17.970 --> 04:19.940
Long time, no see!

04:28.910 --> 04:34.110
<i>There was a young woman abandoned by a man in Tokyo who gave birth to a child all alone.</i>

04:40.170 --> 04:40.210
6th Period

04:40.170 --> 04:45.180
M  E  M  O  R  I  E  S

04:40.670 --> 04:43.690
She lived a taboo existence
in the eyes of her relatives.

04:45.680 --> 04:46.690
How is it?

04:47.470 --> 04:48.930
Is it cute?

04:48.930 --> 04:52.960
Uh-huh. You look wonderful. But still...

04:53.430 --> 04:54.940
Burubu
Japon

04:53.430 --> 04:54.940
A

04:53.430 --> 04:54.940
Go to the beach!
Take your family on
a lavish yet affordable
resort trip

04:53.430 --> 04:54.940
Are you sure about this?

04:55.370 --> 04:58.570
I was finally able to take some vacation time. Maybe a better spot...

04:58.570 --> 05:00.940
It <i>is</i> a great spot. The best!

05:05.050 --> 05:06.450
You're right.

05:08.050 --> 05:09.030
The best.

05:13.870 --> 05:15.870
It's time to eat.

05:26.930 --> 05:32.990
Reiji! I'm heading off to work. Be sure to heat up and eat your breakfast.

05:47.990 --> 05:48.980
Why?

05:49.470 --> 05:49.990
Hmm?

05:51.490 --> 05:54.250
Why did you give birth to a
child without even marrying?

05:57.190 --> 06:01.790
Did you think the guy will
marry you if you had his kid?

06:01.790 --> 06:05.450
<i>A mother like you will be nothing
but trouble for the kid.</i>

06:05.450 --> 06:07.000
It's because...

06:08.970 --> 06:11.010
He told me to have Rin aborted.

06:15.010 --> 06:20.520
<i>If my mother were more like Aki-san... if she would have taken me and left...</i>

06:33.590 --> 06:36.990
<i>I never wanted to hate my own mother.</i>

06:37.370 --> 06:38.530
<i>Yet...</i>

06:59.550 --> 07:03.490
<i>To my utter shame, I was
consoled by a little girl.</i>

07:06.490 --> 07:07.530
Oh?

07:07.910 --> 07:12.210
Rin, have you been sleeping
with him all this time?

07:12.690 --> 07:16.250
Wow, and this girl is incredibly shy.

07:16.530 --> 07:17.540
Wow...

07:18.210 --> 07:20.560
What kind of magic did you use on her?

07:20.560 --> 07:23.040
I... didn't really.

07:23.390 --> 07:24.870
Wow...

07:30.530 --> 07:40.560
<i>Aki-san and Rin brought to the outside world the young boy that was locked inside of me.</i>

07:42.050 --> 07:43.560
Here's your lunch.

07:43.870 --> 07:48.270
I'm going to be late coming home from work tonight.  Could you do me a favor and pick up Rin for me?

07:48.270 --> 07:50.820
Sure. Around three, right?

07:50.820 --> 07:55.230
Uh-huh. I'll make dinner, so be
sure the two of you eat it.

07:55.230 --> 07:57.200
Okay Rin, it's time to go!

08:01.910 --> 08:03.330
Take care of yourself, okay?

08:06.150 --> 08:07.210
<i>Aki-san...</i>

08:12.010 --> 08:13.840
What's that? How cute!

08:17.270 --> 08:18.350
Aki-san?!

08:19.590 --> 08:21.980
5... 6...

08:22.650 --> 08:27.980
7... 8... 9... 10!

08:29.110 --> 08:33.290
R-Rin-chan! Don't grab that!

08:34.930 --> 08:36.450
Adoption?

08:36.750 --> 08:41.700
Look, when it comes time for you to look for a job, I thought it might be better if you had a parent.

08:45.290 --> 08:48.490
Sorry. I don't really...

08:48.490 --> 08:51.210
Uh-uh, I should be sorry.

08:51.230 --> 08:52.970
I should have kept that to myself.

08:53.670 --> 08:57.470
In your mind, you still have a mother and father.

08:57.470 --> 08:59.770
Uh, that's not it.

09:00.370 --> 09:02.990
Come on Rin, it's time to go
beddy-bye in the futon.

09:06.830 --> 09:08.730
All right, good night.

09:13.050 --> 09:14.770
<i>That's not it at all. </i>

09:16.650 --> 09:20.740
<i>I wouldn't be able to marry you. </i>

09:23.090 --> 09:27.250
In any case, an adopted... kid?

09:30.630 --> 09:32.690
<i>I want to quickly become an adult.</i>

09:34.910 --> 09:35.990
<i>Quickly...</i>

09:44.190 --> 09:46.640
I received a tentative offer
from an accounting firm!

09:47.170 --> 09:50.150
They said they'll let me work for them as I study to build up my credentials.

09:51.150 --> 09:53.070
I'll be earning a salary on top of it.

09:53.070 --> 09:55.400
Aki-san, take a break from work and rest up.

09:56.490 --> 09:58.650
I know you've been feeling worn out lately.

09:58.650 --> 10:00.410
Yes, thank you.

10:02.090 --> 10:04.130
<i>Now I can finally...</i>

10:07.810 --> 10:08.960
Are you all right?

10:11.210 --> 10:12.460
I'm fine.

10:17.330 --> 10:19.850
Huh? Wh-What is it?

10:19.850 --> 10:23.470
Aki-san, you've been struggling
all alone for so long.

10:24.330 --> 10:27.850
From now on, you can always rely on me more.

10:31.190 --> 10:31.980
Uh-huh.

10:39.570 --> 10:41.970
Y-You can't. Rin will-

10:43.990 --> 10:44.490
Rei-

11:01.110 --> 11:02.330
<i>I love you.</i>

11:12.910 --> 11:15.430
Ah! I can see it!

11:20.830 --> 11:24.160
How does it look, Aki-san? Do I look odd?

11:24.160 --> 11:29.040
You look fantastic, and very... hand... some...

11:30.600 --> 11:34.040
I can't! Oh my gosh, you look so funny!

11:31.750 --> 11:34.040
Wh-What?!

11:34.610 --> 11:37.300
Please! Just days ago you were
wearing a school uniform!

11:37.810 --> 11:41.300
Suits and whatnot... they're just not you!

11:43.810 --> 11:47.930
So you're going to treat me
like an adult... only at night?

11:48.670 --> 11:51.750
Ah! If you don't leave,
you're going to be late!

11:51.750 --> 11:53.940
Come on, Rin, you too!

11:55.690 --> 11:56.940
I'll see you later.

11:57.510 --> 11:59.940
Where's my goodbye kiss?

12:00.390 --> 12:04.830
I'm sorry. We'll have to skip today.
You might catch my cold.

12:04.830 --> 12:07.370
Your fever hasn't gone down yet?

12:07.370 --> 12:11.210
Uh-uh. I'm going to see the
doctor again before work.

12:14.010 --> 12:15.210
See you later.

12:15.850 --> 12:18.090
See you later!

12:24.330 --> 12:26.720
To think...

12:26.770 --> 12:29.360
<i>...that the day would come that
someone would love me so much.</i>

12:40.980 --> 12:46.240
MATSUNAMI HOSPITAL

12:43.690 --> 12:46.240
Do you have a husband or
any other family members?

12:47.290 --> 12:50.370
Yes. I have a daughter in
nursery school and a cousin.

12:50.370 --> 12:52.430
Is that so?

12:54.160 --> 12:57.750
You have a malignant tumor that has spread throughout the entirety of your right lung.

12:59.790 --> 13:02.030
It's Stage II lung cancer.

13:02.030 --> 13:07.760
In your case, it might be difficult to
remove the entire tumor surgically.

13:11.330 --> 13:17.050
At this point, we'll be able to delay the
progress with radiation and anticancer drugs.

13:24.690 --> 13:26.590
I received a bonus!

13:26.590 --> 13:27.530
A bonus?

13:27.910 --> 13:30.410
My boss did me a real favor.

13:30.890 --> 13:33.550
Here, Aki-san, I'm giving this to you.

13:33.540 --> 13:36.040
AWARD

13:34.050 --> 13:36.170
Really, this much?

13:36.040 --> 13:36.170
AWARD

13:36.690 --> 13:39.420
You're sure there isn't
anything better you want?

13:39.420 --> 13:42.170
It's fine, trust me. In any case...

13:42.170 --> 13:42.250
Futatsubashi -- Katsuda Beach

13:42.650 --> 13:43.510
Here.

13:47.180 --> 13:50.680
There weren't as much people
the last time we came.

13:50.680 --> 13:54.060
It was a secret getaway, but I
guess people found out about it.

13:58.530 --> 13:59.190
Rin?

14:05.330 --> 14:06.070
Look!

14:07.070 --> 14:09.320
When you do this...

14:15.370 --> 14:19.830
You're right! It's saying "whoosh, whoosh!"

14:34.990 --> 14:37.730
Now my "n"...

14:38.670 --> 14:40.930
Put it a little higher right there...

14:41.990 --> 14:43.230
Yes, very good.

14:43.230 --> 14:47.990
REIJI

14:43.230 --> 14:47.990
RIN

14:43.230 --> 14:45.860
AKI

14:47.290 --> 14:50.910
Ah! Mommy's all gone!

14:51.350 --> 14:52.670
Do you want to write it again?

14:52.670 --> 14:55.680
Yeah! Even bigger!

14:57.000 --> 14:59.690
Aki's "A"...

15:04.370 --> 15:08.850
<i>I'm glad. Since you're here, Rin will be...</i>

15:15.100 --> 15:18.170
Rin! You shouldn't be running!

15:19.950 --> 15:21.050
Reiji?

15:23.630 --> 15:26.390
Protect Rin for me.

15:26.970 --> 15:27.860
Please.

15:29.590 --> 15:30.610
Aki-san?

15:34.510 --> 15:35.200
No way.

15:35.750 --> 15:36.650
Huh?

15:38.270 --> 15:41.190
I will take care of you too, not just Rin.

15:43.470 --> 15:44.460
Dummy.

15:47.110 --> 15:50.910
No fair! Hug me too!

15:55.510 --> 15:56.220
Aki-san?

15:57.750 --> 15:59.730
If you're not feeling well, we should stop.

16:01.530 --> 16:03.070
I'm sorry.

16:03.070 --> 16:06.250
The trip must have been hard on you.

16:06.250 --> 16:08.480
Uh-uh, you're wrong.

16:08.910 --> 16:10.210
Keep going.

16:10.210 --> 16:11.250
We can't.

16:12.410 --> 16:13.490
Let's stop here.

16:14.390 --> 16:16.250
You need to recover.

16:16.250 --> 16:19.080
Be a good girl and take a break from work.

16:21.610 --> 16:22.580
There, there.

16:30.610 --> 16:32.090
Why did you keep this from me?

16:32.530 --> 16:35.410
I had the doctor estimate the costs.

16:35.990 --> 16:40.990
The amount needed to extend my life for six
months would support that girl for three years.

16:41.370 --> 16:45.190
You don't mean... just because of money?

16:45.190 --> 16:47.230
<i>I'm working too.  </i>

16:48.860 --> 16:50.070
<i>I'm an adult now.</i>

16:50.070 --> 16:53.740
Anyway, please don't worry about it!

16:54.130 --> 16:56.330
Please, Aki-san.

16:56.330 --> 16:57.740
Take the treatment.

16:57.740 --> 16:59.740
MATSUNAMI HOSPITAL

17:01.090 --> 17:04.650
Where's Mommy's room?

17:04.650 --> 17:05.250
Rin.

17:06.090 --> 17:07.970
Don't run and hurt yourself.

17:14.510 --> 17:17.310
Have you been a good girl at home?

17:17.310 --> 17:18.570
Yes I have!

17:18.570 --> 17:19.050
Good!

17:19.650 --> 17:21.000
<i>She doesn't know a thing.</i>

17:21.000 --> 17:22.710
Good girl!

17:27.550 --> 17:32.270
<i>The side effects included unending bouts of nausea and chills.  </i>

17:32.290 --> 17:37.160
<i>She remained listless as she lost her hair along with her strength. </i>

17:38.270 --> 17:41.030
The cancer has now metastasized into her liver.

17:41.030 --> 17:47.530
As for her chances of survival, to be honest with you, we may have to prepare for the worst.

17:47.530 --> 17:50.350
<i>I thought I had finally grown up. </i>

17:51.410 --> 17:55.690
<i>I thought I now had the power to protect those most dear to me. </i>

17:56.590 --> 17:57.690
<i>But...</i>

18:00.410 --> 18:01.750
<i>In the end...</i>

18:02.750 --> 18:05.290
<i>I remain ever so ignorant.</i>

18:06.490 --> 18:09.400
<i>Ever so... powerless.</i>

18:09.400 --> 18:11.900
NURSERY SCHOOL

18:10.570 --> 18:11.900
Rin!

18:12.630 --> 18:15.030
It's time to go, Rin!

18:22.030 --> 18:24.490
Rin, don't make trouble.

18:36.690 --> 18:37.670
Reiji?

18:44.150 --> 18:46.930
Is Mommy going to die?

18:50.770 --> 18:53.790
She won't die! She'll be cured.

18:54.070 --> 18:55.830
She'll come back to us.

18:57.570 --> 19:03.270
<i>For two months, her tumor marker
readings have not decreased at all.</i>

19:12.310 --> 19:13.210
Reiji.

19:14.090 --> 19:17.710
I want to go home. I want to go back.

19:19.230 --> 19:21.570
Uh-huh. You bet.

19:22.130 --> 19:23.590
Let's go.

19:24.510 --> 19:25.770
Let's go back.

19:27.010 --> 19:30.790
Back to our home.

19:33.590 --> 19:36.930
How cute. You folded it very well.

19:36.940 --> 19:39.690
You're not going to the hospital anymore?

19:39.690 --> 19:43.200
Nope. I am always going to stay right with you.

19:44.130 --> 19:45.870
Always.

19:52.210 --> 19:57.130
<i>From then on, Rin continued to fold paper cranes every day.  </i>

19:58.530 --> 20:03.370
<i>She believed if she folded 1,000 of them, Aki-san would recover from her illness.</i>

20:18.590 --> 20:19.990
I beg you.

20:20.430 --> 20:23.270
At least until she...

20:25.470 --> 20:27.650
...enters grade school.

20:31.950 --> 20:36.960
My Lord, my God.

20:39.510 --> 20:42.130
Rin... Rin?

20:45.350 --> 20:46.350
Rin?

21:01.010 --> 21:01.900
Aki-san?

21:01.900 --> 21:04.150
I'M SORRY

21:02.450 --> 21:04.150
Aki-san!

21:06.970 --> 21:07.920
I'm sorry.

21:09.850 --> 21:12.830
I'm sorry... for dying.

21:18.430 --> 21:19.670
It's beautiful!

21:24.190 --> 21:25.470
Why is it?

21:26.230 --> 21:26.840
Hmm?

21:26.980 --> 21:31.780
namae wo yonda toki no

21:26.980 --> 21:31.780
The nonchalant answers you gave

21:28.610 --> 21:30.830
Whenever I see the sunset...

21:31.950 --> 21:35.440
I suddenly want to go back home.

21:32.260 --> 21:37.160
nanigenai henji ga

21:32.260 --> 21:37.160
when I called out your name

21:38.200 --> 21:44.720
dorehodo no shiawase ka

21:38.200 --> 21:44.720
gave me a joy

21:44.330 --> 21:47.570
I will never forgive anyone who will hurt Rin.

21:44.720 --> 21:49.400
shirazu ni ita yo

21:44.720 --> 21:49.400
that was immeasurable.

21:48.110 --> 21:52.370
I will never let anybody...
anybody... lay a hand on Rin.

21:51.060 --> 21:54.170
zutto zutto

21:51.060 --> 21:54.170
I really believed

21:54.170 --> 21:57.240
konna hibi ga

21:54.170 --> 21:57.240
I would spend those

21:57.270 --> 22:01.370
tsuzuitekunda to

21:57.270 --> 22:01.370
bygone days with you

22:01.420 --> 22:06.970
shinjiteta kara

22:01.420 --> 22:06.970
forever and ever. . .

22:07.800 --> 22:14.790
me wo hosomete yasashiku warau

22:07.800 --> 22:14.790
I loved how you smiled gently

22:14.790 --> 22:20.700
anata wo aishiteita

22:14.790 --> 22:20.700
with your eyes half-closed.

22:20.760 --> 22:26.820
dakishimeta kata no hososa

22:20.760 --> 22:26.820
The slenderness of your shoulders I hugged.

22:23.770 --> 22:26.400
CHERRY BLOSSOM
CLASS
KOKONOE RIN

22:26.920 --> 22:32.340
nukumori mo sono koe mo oboeteru

22:26.920 --> 22:32.340
I will also remember your warmth and your voice.

22:32.340 --> 22:39.150
tsutaeru koto dekinai kimochi

22:32.340 --> 22:39.150
My heart is filled with so many

22:39.150 --> 22:45.530
ima mo mune ni afureteru

22:39.150 --> 22:45.530
feelings I can't express to you.

22:45.550 --> 22:51.340
donna ni aenakute mo

22:45.550 --> 22:51.340
Even if I cannot be with you now

22:51.340 --> 23:01.300
anata no ita fuutei wo wasurenai

22:51.340 --> 23:01.300
I will never forget the way you were.

23:09.650 --> 23:12.450
My beloved daughter.

23:12.440 --> 23:15.060
I  LOVE  YOU

23:15.080 --> 23:27.050
NEXT EPISODE

23:16.130 --> 23:18.080
A burning campfire!

23:18.390 --> 23:21.790
And a burning hot night with me and Rin-chan!

23:21.790 --> 23:25.300
It'll be hot and heavy and totally intense!

23:25.300 --> 23:29.290
That said, go die in fire already, Aoki Daisuke!

23:26.990 --> 23:30.110
SCHOOL CAMPING TRIP

23:27.090 --> 23:30.090
7th Period

23:30.090 --> 23:41.120
See You Next Volume ! (^_^)
